# founder: one person holds every seat the organization leaves open.
#   hale habitat graft <dir> --attach --with founder --set founder=<who>
#   hale dna pack apply founder --set founder=<who>
# With a graft, the seats are the holes it opens (the Board, each part's dev
# and reviewer, each deployment's operator), proposed in the same breath and
# ratified by the same `hale dna review all approve`. One person in a part's
# dev and its reviewer is allowed only under `dna.trust = local`.
fill * {founder}
